#X text 20 10 Every example plays a note (C E G C \, one per corner). The neuron says 1 and is right: a bell. Says 1 but should not: a buzz. Says 0 but should have said 1: a dull thud. Says 0 and is right: silence. A trained AND gate therefore sounds like: rest \, rest \, rest \, bell., f 120;
