#X text 630 692 1) next example p = 0 1 2 3 0 ..., f 30;
#X text 630 726 2) its inputs: x1 = p div 2 \, x2 = p mod 2, f 30;
#X text 630 760 3) its target t (from the gate table), f 30;
#X text 630 794 4) the neuron answers: y = 1 if w1*x1 + w2*x2 + b > 0, f 30;
#X text 630 828 5) the error e = t - y (-1 \, 0 or +1), f 30;
#X text 630 862 6) LEARN: nudge each weight by rate * e * its input, f 30;
#X text 630 896 7) show it \, play it \, move the line, f 30;
